{"acceleration_structures":[],"air_sha256":"7a7c697f30cb0e7973c6fa0658b99cb030bbe90ca6b4cd8e3edb9ef55204b906","argument_buffer_buffers":[],"argument_buffer_intersection_function_tables":[],"argument_buffer_textures":[],"authored_by":"claude:opus-5","buffers":[{"binding":0,"initial_bytes_b64":"vvQIv3R6vr+gPFm/nVJ9Pw==","role":"in_out"},{"binding":1,"bytes_b64":"X85PwOlvzr/WFDNATMBtQA==","role":"input"},{"binding":2,"bytes_b64":"zczMPQ==","role":"input"}],"case_id":"6d3a2ac3ace952a2f8309dfdff5e1f6a281d00d341a25d8e30b3cd111bed3515","compare":{"kind":"exact"},"device_buffer_arrays":[],"dispatch":{"grid":[4,1,1],"threads_per_threadgroup":[1,1,1]},"entry":"StyleEngineCoefficients::filterStep","execution_safety":"loop_free","function_constants":[],"intersection_function_tables":[],"kernel_stage_inputs":[],"name":"accumulate-four-weighted-coefficients-as-one-fused-step","output":{"binding":0,"kind":"buffer","length":16,"offset":0},"rationale":"The kernel is one multiply feeding one add, so nothing else can move the result and the four lanes are independent. The module is compiled air.compile.fast_math_enable and both operations carry the fast flag, which lets the pair be contracted into a fused multiply-add. All four coefficient/accumulator pairs are chosen so the fused answer and the separately rounded one land on different floats, so the sixteen observed bytes say which of the two the pipeline performed.","render_targets":[],"samplers":[],"stage":"kernel","texture_arrays":[],"textures":[],"threadgroup_memory":[],"vertex_inputs":[],"visible_function_references":[],"visible_function_tables":[]}
